{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26012","headline":"山中冬思二首 一 · 鲍溶","name":"山中冬思二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山深先冬寒，败叶与林齐。\n门巷非世路，何人念穷栖。\n哀风破山起，夕雪误鸣鸡。\n巢鸟侵旦出，饥猨无声啼。\n晨兴动烟火，开云伐冰溪。\n老木寒更瘦，阴云晴亦低。\n我贫自求力，颜色常低迷。\n时思灵台下，游子正凄凄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26012.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26012","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}